<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was very slow in the panhandle late Tuesday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 900 head slaughter steers and 800 head heifers; 32,000 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 18,400 head formulated and 100 head previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1150-1200 lbs 67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1050-1100 lbs 67.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:   1,700    Week Ago:    200    Year Ago:     700</p>
<p>Wk to date: 32,000    Week Ago: 22,000    Year Ago:  14,200</p>
</text>
